WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:04.830
Your registration. Your insurance card.
Where are they when you need them?

00:05.100 --> 00:07.520
Car Papers keeps both on your iPhone.

00:08.250 --> 00:13.270
It's free. There's no sign-in.
Setup is easy, and it works as soon as you download it.

00:13.600 --> 00:16.180
Take a photo, and it reads the details for you.

00:18.300 --> 00:20.630
Show them full screen, in one tap.

00:21.900 --> 00:25.190
Widgets put them right on your Home Screen,
and your Lock Screen.

00:26.500 --> 00:29.200
And get a reminder before either one expires.

00:30.450 --> 00:32.840
No account. Nothing leaves your phone.

00:33.800 --> 00:36.830
Car Papers. Free, and ready when you need them.
